   Bluetooth transport, with a plain explanation; handle denial with a clear message.
2. Bluetooth Classic: a device picker listing bonded (already paired) devices by name + MAC, remembered in prefs; connect
   with createRfcommSocketToServiceRecord(SPP UUID 00001101-0000-1000-8000-00805F9B34FB), cancelDiscovery first, and
