3. Wi-Fi TCP: connect to a host:port the user can edit, default 192.168.0.10:35000, through WifiTcpTransport.
   (Bluetooth LE can stay "coming soon" with an honest message instead of an error.)
4. Live session: mode "live"; after the ELM init + fingerprint, read the VIN (Mode 09) and send the vehicle to the
