   truncated only. Wrap the live transport in RecordingTransport so the session is recorded to the .mmrec like the sim.
   Keep every safety rule: the allowlist in Elm327Driver is unchanged; no writes.
5. Show progress on screen at each step (permission, connecting, ATZ, protocol, VIN, live data) and log to logcat with
